<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Victoria says budget on track.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Victoria says budget on track.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of the Australian state of Victoria said on Wednesday it was on track to meet its forecast underlying budget deficit of A$700,000 for the year to June 30, 1997 but announced a first-quarter underlying deficit of A$31 million.</p>
</text>
